cintx provenance note
---------------------

Vendored for Phase 19 (int1e_ecp_* Type-1 / Type-2 evaluator). These files
are the primary byte-identity oracle for cintx's `int1e_ecp_*` family per
phase decision D-01 (REVISED 2026-05-12): libcint 6.1.3 upstream ships no
ECP source, so PySCF's nr_ecp.{c,h} + nr_ecp_deriv.c is the canonical
C-level reference for the algorithm cintx must reproduce.

The shim headers under `include/np_helper/np_helper.h` and
`include/vhf/fblas.h` are minimal cintx-authored stubs (NOT from upstream
PySCF) that satisfy the `#include` directives in nr_ecp.c without pulling
the full pyscf/lib/{np_helper,vhf} sources. They are not Apache-2.0
PySCF code; see `.planning/notes/pyscf-nr-ecp-vendor-subset.md`.

The `src/dgemm_shim.c` file is a cintx-authored minimal reference
`dgemm_` implementation used only to satisfy the BLAS symbol dependency
of nr_ecp.c when no system BLAS is available. It is NOT from upstream
PySCF.
